note keyword_prefix: regression guard at omc 62775d2a. A name of 9..63 bytes is never a
note keyword by its first 8 bytes, so continue_x compiles and returns 7. An exact keyword
note name is still error 16. Older pin 2c824805 refused this file with error 16 on line 4.
fn continue_x to int
ret 7
end
fn main to int
ret continue_x
end
